
"smart_sources:2026-03-16 - Newly unearthed Eagle zoning changes could impact Costco.md": {"path":"2026-03-16 - Newly unearthed Eagle zoning changes could impact Costco.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"17teh66","at":1785795030606},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1785347215852,"size":5087,"at":1785795030894,"hash":"17teh66"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"##Costco a no go? Rule passed but never published could doom warehouse plan":[10,46],"##Costco a no go? Rule passed but never published could doom warehouse plan#{1}":[12,46]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev","target":"Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev","line":5},{"title":"would have transformed the 27-acre former gravel quarry between Idaho Highway 55 and Horseshoe Bend Road","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2018/08/15/quarry-village-eagle-idaho/","line":18},{"title":"Washington Trust - Wilcox - 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/dce5e549-15d3-4296-8c4b-239eb9eabc77.png","line":22,"embedded":true},{"title":"Costco is now eying development","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/01/07/costco-eagle-plan/","line":26},{"title":"as BoiseDev reported.","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/01/07/costco-eagle-plan/","line":28},{"title":"Regence - 2:1 - Business Grow","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/6f251bf1-00e6-48d7-8365-570820fe299b.gif","line":32,"embedded":true},{"title":"City of Eagle has been considering since at least last summer.","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2025/06/16/eagle-density-reduction/","line":40},{"title":"Washington Trust - Wilcox - 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/dce5e549-15d3-4296-8c4b-239eb9eabc77.png","line":42,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Newly unearthed Eagle zoning changes could impact Costco","source":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/03/13/costco-eagle-compplan/","author":["[[Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev]]"],"published":"2026-03-16","created":"2026-07-29","description":"Five years ago, Eagle gave its blessing to start development of an upscale, walkable mixed-use development on Hill Road. The project, called Quarry Village, would have transformed the 27-acre former gravel quarry between Idaho Highway 55 and Horseshoe Bend Road into a development featuring entertainment, shopping, boutique retail, and housing packed into a single development. […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},